# Allow to build Zink without MoltenVK on MacOS
# https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa/-/merge_requests/38605 state=opened
# ### What does this MR do and why?

With the new KosmicKrisp "Vulkan-to-Metal" layer, MoltenVK is no more the exclusive solution on Apple.

At the moment it still doesn't work due to the lack of nullDescriptor feature of KHR/EXT robustness2 same for MoltenVK.

But it build and maybe it will come soon @aitor
